<title>SPAIN: IBCA raises BBV individual rating to A/B.</title>
<headline>IBCA raises BBV individual rating to A/B.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>London's rating agency IBCA has raised Banco Bilbao Vizcaya's individual rating to A/B from B, the bank said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>BBV said IBCA's decision had been based on the bank's profitability compared to its competition and its favourable position in the market.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
